{
  "camel_example": "aliyun ecs StartInstances --region cn-hangzhou --RegionId 'cn-hangzhou' --InstanceId.1 'i-bp67acfmxazb4p0000'",
  "cmd_full_name": "ecs start-instances",
  "cmd_name": "start-instances",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Starts multiple ECS instances in a batch. You can specify parameters to select different batch operation modes for flexible startup",
  "description_zh": "本接口用于批量启动 ECS 实例，支持通过设置参数来选择不同的批量操作模式，为您提供灵活的启动方式",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ecs start-instances --biz-region-id cn-hangzhou --instance-id i-bp67acfmxazb4p0000 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": false,
  "name": "StartInstances",
  "operation": {
    "action": "StartInstances",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2014-05-26",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "readAndWrite",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "update",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "false",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to perform only a dry run. Valid values:\n\ntrue: performs only a dry run. The system checks the required parameters, request format, and instance status. If the check fails, the corresponding fault is returned. If the check succeeds, `DRYRUN.SUCCESS` is returned.\nIf the BatchOptimization parameter is set to `SuccessFirst`, the dry run with `DryRun=true` returns only `DRYRUN.SUCCESS`.\n\nfalse: sends a Normal request. After the check succeeds, the instances are started.\n\nDefault value: false",
      "help_zh": "是否只预检此次请求。取值范围：\n\ntrue：发送检查请求，不会启动实例。检查项包括是否填写了必需参数、请求格式、实例状态。如果检查不通过，则返回对应错误。如果检查通过，则返回`DRYRUN.SUCCESS`。\n如果参数`BatchOptimization`被设置为`SuccessFirst`，对应的`DryRun=true`的预检结果只会返回`DRYRUN.SUCCESS`。\n\nfalse：发送正常请求，通过检查后直接启动实例。\n\n默认值：false",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "dry_run",
      "options": [
        "--dry-run"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DryRun",
      "required": false,
      "type": "bool"
    },
    {
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID of the instances. You can invoke https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html to query the most recent region list",
      "help_zh": "实例所在的地域。您可以调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/25609.html查看最新的阿里云地域列表",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
      "options": [
        "--biz-region-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RegionId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "AllTogether",
      "help_en": "The batch operation pattern. Valid values:\n\nAllTogether: In this pattern, if all instances are started, a success message is returned. If any instance fails validation, all instances fail to start and a failed message is returned.\n\nSuccessFirst: In this pattern, each instance is started separately. The response contains the operation result for each instance.\n\nDefault value: AllTogether",
      "help_zh": "设置批量操作模式。取值范围：\n\nAllTogether：该模式下，如果实例全部启动成功，则返回成功信息；如果任意一个实例校验不通过，则所有实例启动失败，并返回失败信息。\n\nSuccessFirst：该模式下，分别启动每个实例，返回结果包含每个实例的操作结果信息。\n\n默认值：AllTogether",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "batch_optimization",
      "options": [
        "--batch-optimization"
      ],
      "raw_name": "BatchOptimization",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "element": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "example": "i-bp67acfmxazb4p****",
      "help_en": "The list of instance IDs. Valid values of the array length: 1 to 100",
      "help_zh": "实例ID数组。数组长度：1~100",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "instance_id",
      "options": [
        "--instance-id"
      ],
      "param_style": "repeatList",
      "raw_name": "InstanceId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "array"
    }
  ],
